				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation><![CDATA[EDI: RFF.C506.1153
Reference types
CR	= Customers reference for the order
CT	= Contract number
ON	= End customer’s order number
AEP	= Project identifier
ALL	= Message batch number (unique message identifier e.g. from header segment)
ZOT	= Document type (SAP: UB…)
AAL	= Drawing number 
